# Base URL of the Express server (server/), no trailing slash.
#
# This is an override, not a requirement. Unset, the client picks for itself:
# http://localhost:3000 in development, https://tubeko.onrender.com in a
# production build. Set it to point a deployment at a different server, and
# allow the client's origin on the server side with ALLOWED_ORIGINS in
# server/.env. Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to the bundle.
VITE_API_BASE=

# Base URL of the Cloudflare Worker relay (worker/), no trailing slash.
#
# Optional. Set it and downloads stream straight from Cloudflare's edge instead
# of through the Express server, which lifts the ~2-3 simultaneous-download
# ceiling that Render's free instance imposes and stops downloads eating its
# 5 GB/month egress. Unset, the client falls back to the server's /stream route.
# Deploy the worker first: see worker/README.md.
VITE_RELAY_BASE=
